# Docs: https://www.chezmoi.io/reference/special-files-and-directories/chezmoiignore

# General Ignore Patterns
# chezmoi patterns match full target paths: no-slash patterns only match at the
# top level, so depth-varying junk needs the **/ prefix (unlike .gitignore).
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Repo-only files
.pre-commit-config.yaml
README.md
docs/chezmoi-inconsistent-state.md
docs/machine-performance-optimizations.md
dot_config/mise/rust-toolchain.md

# Config file managed by run_once script and update-config.sh helper
.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml

# Helper files (not target files)
.config/chezmoi/.update-chezmoi-toml.tmpl
.config/chezmoi/README.md

# Configuration files for pre-commit
.luacheckrc
.luarc.json
.stylua.toml
selene.toml
vim.toml
